{"id":"H7498","lemma":"רָפָא","transliteration":"rapah","sayIt":"ra-pah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Raphah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.8.37;\nson of: Binea (H1150);\nbrother of: Eleasah (H0501H) and Azel (H0682A); also called Rephaiah at 1Ch.9.43;\nAlso named: re.pha.yah (רְפָיָה \"Rephaiah\" H7509K)\n§ Rapha = \"tall\"\n1) son of Binea and a descendant of Saul\n2) son of Benjamin","glosses":["rapha","raphah"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Rapha","kjv":"and Rapha"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"Raphah","kjv":"Rapha"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:2","note":"Nohah the fourth, and Rapha the fifth.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7220","lemma":"רֹאשׁ","transliteration":"rosh","gloss":"Rosh"},{"id":"H7509","lemma":"רְפָיָה","transliteration":"rephayah","gloss":"Rephaiah"},{"id":"H0501","lemma":"אֶלְעָשָׂה","transliteration":"elasah","gloss":"Eleasah"},{"id":"H0682","lemma":"אָצֵל","transliteration":"atsel","gloss":"Azel"},{"id":"H1150","lemma":"בִּנְעָא","transliteration":"bina","gloss":"Binea"},{"id":"H1144","lemma":"בִּנְיָמִין","transliteration":"binyamin","gloss":"Benjamin"},{"id":"H1106","lemma":"בֶּ֫לַע","transliteration":"bela","gloss":"Bela"},{"id":"H1071","lemma":"בֶּ֫כֶר","transliteration":"bekher","gloss":"Becher"}],"senses":[{"id":"H7498H","gloss":"Rapha","relation":"H7498H = a Name of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}